        "description": "A recipe's page: id, name, description, rating and rating count, review and photo counts, author, published / updated dates, prep / cook / additional / total time, servings and yield, ingredients (as written and split into quantity, unit and name, with group headings), directions with their step photos, nutrition per serving and the full nutrition facts table, category, cuisine, keywords, breadcrumbs, images, video and the featured reviews. `doc_id` is the key for reviews and questions.\n\nEvery response includes `credits_used`: the credits this call cost.\n\nPrice: 1 credit per successful call. Docs: https://api.sh/docs/allrecipes-recipe",
        "tags": [
          "Allrecipes"
        ],
        "x-credits": 1,
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
